Section: Tweaks
Description: SoundCloud deprecated its v1 API and the password OAuth grant this old client relies on, breaking login, streaming, search, and likes/reposts on iOS 6. This tweak rewrites v1 API calls to the current v2 endpoints, fixes the resulting response/field mismatches, and adds a manual credential entry screen since automated login is no longer possible. Configuration for the endpoint rewrites lives in an external YAML file, editable without reinstalling.
Author: kern0x1b
Name: SoundCloud iOS 6 Fix

